{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123602","id":4567858456,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEEP9GA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123602","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123602.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123602.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123602","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123602/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123602/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123602/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/b27ecd7b21c9ca9608d3e4ea2877aa2d3bbb3e8f","number":123602,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix CompressedTexture2D mipmap reporting","user":{"login":"jojjolindquist","id":120167356,"node_id":"U_kgDOBymbvA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/120167356?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist","html_url":"https://github.com/jojjolindquist","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jojjolindquist/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes #123499\r\n\r\n`CompressedTexture2D` always returned `false/0` from `has_mipmaps()` and  `get_mipmap_count()`, because it didn't override the default methods from `Texture2D`.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"887\" height=\"550\" alt=\"Skärmavbild 2026-09-18 kl  11 05 43\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da908520-7dcd-45a5-a7e0-dba174bcdb8c\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThe mipmap count is now stored from the image when the texture is loaded. `CompressedTexture2D` overrides both `has_mipmaps()` and  `get_mipmap_count()`. The count is also updated when the texture is reloaded.\r\n<img width=\"809\" height=\"529\" alt=\"Skärmavbild 2026-09-18 kl  11 55 36\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/61c45b86-0824-4bd6-b18d-6caa5077ce3b\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAI was used to explain the issue and help with following the contribution guidelines.\r\n\r\nThis is my first PR to Godot, so any feedback is welcome!","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https:/